# Design System §13.2 rule 4: never hand-edit components/ui/.
#
# That directory is shadcn CLI output. Re-running the CLI has to stay safe, so
# a component is extended through a `cva` variant or a wrapper in
# components/app/, never by editing the generated file. Ownership here makes
# any change to it a deliberate, reviewed act.
/resources/js/components/ui/ @imonroe

# The documents are the source of truth for scope, naming, and design. A change
# to one is a decision, not a tidy-up.
/docs/ @imonroe
/CLAUDE.md @imonroe

